            {"cmd":"memorizeBgmBgs"},
            {"cmd":"playBgm","audio":{"name":"XD 39 ONBS News Broadcast","volume":100,"pitch":100}},
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,13]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "News anchor:...and now we're joined by the President of the Pokémon Association, Giovanni.\\nSir, it's truly an honor to have you here."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,12]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[facegiovanni]Giovanni: \\bIt's my pleasure. I always make time to speak directly to the people of Kanto."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,13]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "It’s been inspiring to watch your vision for Kanto take shape so quickly. Of course, with progress comes change - some folks have noticed increased security around cities.\\nCan you share how that's keeping us all safe?"
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,12]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[facegiovanni]\\bAbsolutely. These measures are purely for public safety.\\nThe Association is stepping in to ensure peace and stability."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,13]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "It's comforting to know the Association is acting so decisively.\\nThere’s been… well, some exaggerated chatter about restricted access to places. What would you say to calm those concerns?"
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,12]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[facegiovanni]\\bExaggerated indeed. Standard security protocols, nothing more. Our only goal is providing peace of mind. Kanto deserves that."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,13]},
            {"cmd":"text","text":"And under your leadership, that’s exactly what we have."},
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,13]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "Before we wrap up, some rumors have popped up, you know how stories spread. Something about a special research project involving rare Pokémon?"
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,12]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[facegiovanni]\\bThe Pokémon Association has always led scientific progress for the good of both humans and Pokémon. Our current initiatives are focused entirely on healthcare, protection, and prosperity.\\nThe future is bright for Kanto."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,13]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "Well said, Mr. President. That’s all the time we have,  thank you for your dedication, and for keeping Kanto strong."
            },
            {"cmd":"fadeOutBgm","seconds":2},
            {"cmd":"wait","seconds":1.0},
            {
              "cmd": "moveRoute",
              "character": 12,
              "route": {"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"list":[{"move":"turnLeft"}]}
            },
            {"cmd":"waitForMoveCompletion"},
            {"cmd":"playBgm","audio":{"name":"Association-evil-theme","volume":100,"pitch":100}},
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,12]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[facegiovanni]Giovanni:\\b That was an awful interview!\\nHow dare you ask all these difficult questions?!"
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,12]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[facegiovanni]\\bLet's erase all this footage and find someone else to interview me!"
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,12]},
            {"cmd":"text","text":"\\f[facegiovanni]\\bYou're fired!"},
            {
              "cmd": "moveRoute",
              "character": 12,
              "route": {"repeat":false,"skippable":false,"list":[{"move":"turnDown"}]}
            },
            {"cmd":"waitForMoveCompletion"},
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,12]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[facegiovanni]\\bAnd get these cameras out of my face, I have important business to attend to."
            },
            {
              "cmd": "moveRoute",
              "character": 12,
